 4 : 2•2 (Note: 2•2 does not work because  a  and  b  need to be distinct)
16 : 4•4 or 8•2 (Note: 4•4 does not work because  a  and  b  need to be distinct)
36 : 2•18 or 3•12 or 4•9 
