&\lambda_{n} = 0 \\
&\lambda_{i-1} = \dfrac{\partial h_i}{\partial x_i}^T\lambda_i + \dfrac{\partial p_i}{\partial x_i}^T\beta_i(\phi)
\end{align*} 
where  $\beta_i$  and  $p_i = p_i(x_i)$  are scalars. 
